OL,3,GNEWSATory switch makes Labour council's
OL,4,Abiggest party
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is facing a political shift
OL,7,Fafter a long-standing Tory quit for a
OL,8,Frival party set up by the town's MP.
OL,10,FJames Bensly, a member of the
OL,11,FConservative cabinet at Great Yarmouth
OL,12,FBorough Council for several years, has
OL,13,Fjoined Great Yarmouth First/Restore
OL,14,FBritain, founded by Rupert Lowe after
OL,15,Fhe was suspended by Reform UK.
OL,17,FHis switch means Labour is now the
OL,18,Flargest party at the council, which has
OL,19,Fbeen Conservative-led but under no
OL,20,Foverall control since 2023.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
