OL,3,GNEWSATory switch makes Labour council's
OL,4,Abiggest party
OL,5,
OL,6,FLowe called the move a "massive boost"
OL,7,Ffor his party's ambitions, while Daniel
OL,8,FCandon, Conservative parliamentary
OL,9,Fspokesman for Great Yarmouth, accused
OL,10,FBensly of "putting personal ambition
OL,11,Fahead of principle".
